  "description": "Build a **General Help Desk application for enterprises**.\n\nThe system should have 3 roles: **Employee, Support Agent, and Admin**.\n\n\nCore features:\n\n* Employees can create support tickets with **title, description, category, priority, and attachment**.\n* Support Agents can **view, assign, update, comment on, and resolve tickets**.\n* Ticket status should follow: **Open \u2192 Assigned \u2192 In Progress \u2192 Resolved \u2192 Closed**.\n* Employees can view their tickets and track status.\n* Admin can manage **users, categories, priorities, and tickets**.\n* Provide **search, filtering, and dashboards** showing ticket count by status and priority.\n* Add proper **mandatory-field validation, error messages, and success messages**.\n* Store all ticket changes in an **activity/history log**.\n* Create a clean, simple, enterprise-style UI.\n\nMake the application fully functional with working **frontend, backend, database, authentication, validations, and workflows**.",
